/ActualText (In my opinion, the table reveals a concerning trend at Tips Industries, where significant pay increases for Kumar Taurani and Ramesh Taurani at 15% and 12%, respectively, highlight a growing disparity between top management and employees. The 0.8 remuneration ratio for independent directors, coupled with no increase in their pay, suggests they may struggle to exert influence on board decisions. This imbalance raises red flags regarding corporate governance, as it could undermine the effectiveness of oversight and strategic direction within the company. I believe this situation warrants closer scrutiny to ensure a fair and equitable reward structure.)
